        <img loading="lazy" class="mw-100 h-auto hero-image" src="/images/default-source/banners/athletics_1920x540.jpg?sfvrsn=5268952_5" title="Athletics_1920x540" alt="FSCJ Athletics"
         
          />
 <div id="Body_C002_Col00" class="sf_colsIn container fscj-container" data-sf-element="FSCJ-Container" data-placeholder-label="FSCJ-Container"><div class="row" data-sf-element="Row">
    <div id="Body_C009_Col00" class="sf_colsIn col-lg-6" data-sf-element="Column 1" data-placeholder-label="Column 1">
<div >
    <div ><h2>Meet Your New Mascot!</h2><p>Huge news! We are excited to announce FSCJ's new official mascot is the Manta Ray.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br>Following extensive research, design and two public voting phases, we are beginning to incorporate the Manta Ray across FSCJ, FSCJ Athletics and the full College community. </p><p>Here's how the Manta Ray came out on top:</p><ul type="disc"><li data-list="0" data-level="1">In October 2023, FSCJ invited the      public to vote on their favorite mascots from a list of 25.</li><li data-list="0" data-level="1">Close to 9,000 votes and 864      write-in names were received.</li><li data-list="0" data-level="1">The list was narrowed down to the      top three: Kraken, Manta Ray and Sea Dragon.</li><li data-list="0" data-level="1">The public voting window to      select the winner was open between January 17 and February 23, 2024,      garnering nearly 20,000 votes.</li><li data-list="0" data-level="1">The official mascot was announced      during the 2024 Commencement Ceremony on May 9.</li></ul><p>We appreciate your participation and look forward to seeing how the Manta Ray comes to life! </p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div>    
</div>
<div >
    <div ><h5>Contact Information:</h5><p>Athletics Office<br>11901 Beach Blvd, Jacksonville, FL 32225<br>(904) 646-2119 | <a href="mailto:athletics@fscj.edu">athletics@fscj.edu</a></p><h5></h5></div>    
</div>
<div >
    <div ><h2>Follow Us</h2></div>    
</div>
<div >
    <div ><p style="text-align: center">Follow @FSCJMantaRays on <a href="https://twitter.com/" target="_blank" data-sf-ec-immutable=""><em class="fa-brands fa-x-twitter"></em></a></p></div>    
</div>
<div >
    <div ><p style="text-align: center">Like&nbsp;@FSCJMantaRays on <a href="https://facebook.com/" target="_blank" data-sf-ec-immutable=""><em class="fa-brands fa-square-facebook"></em></a></p></div>    
</div>
    </div>
    <div id="Body_C009_Col01" class="sf_colsIn col-lg-6" data-sf-element="Column 2" data-placeholder-label="Column 2">
<div style="padding:41.67% 0 0 0;position:relative;">
  <iframe 
    id="vimeoPlayer"
    src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/938310575?h=57593bd11a&badge=0&autoplay=1&autopause=0&player_id=0&app_id=58479"
    frameborder="0"
    allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write"
    style="position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;"
    title="FSCJ Mascot Reveal">
  </iframe>
</div>

<script src="https://player.vimeo.com/api/player.js"></script>
<script>
  const iframe = document.getElementById('vimeoPlayer');
  const player = new Vimeo.Player(iframe);

  player.ready().then(function () {
    player.setVolume(0.3); // 30% volume
  }).catch(function (error) {
    console.error('Vimeo player error:', error);
  });
</script>
<div >
    <div ><p style="text-align: center"><img alt="FSCJ Manta Rays Logo" src="/images/default-source/logos/logo_stamp.png?sfvrsn=a643e461_2" sf-size="60458"></p></div>    
</div>
